        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "(“ARKO Parent”), which is one of the largest operators of convenience stores in the U.S., whose common stock is listed on the Nasdaq Stock Market (“Nasdaq”) under the symbol “ARKO.” We primarily engage in wholesale activity, which includes the supply of fuel to gas stations operated by third-party dealers;",
